<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">在干嘛呢</text><text for="L2">怎么啦</text><text for="L3">哪怕只聊十分钟 也抽不出空吗</text><text for="L4">出什么事了吗</text><text for="L5">没有 倒也没什么特别的事</text><text for="L6">只是想听听你的声音 哪怕片刻也好</text><text for="L7">这样啊 可我今天实在好困</text><text for="L8">抱歉啦</text><text for="L9">知道啦 也是没办法的事呢</text><text for="L10">那就晚安咯</text><text for="L11">若把这当作委曲求全</text><text for="L12">算是我太任性吗</text><text for="L13">头像里浅笑嫣然的你</text><text for="L14">如今目光却仿佛再不曾与我相交</text><text for="L15">曾经是怎样呢 又是如何做到</text><text for="L16">我们曾怎样彼此凝望呢</text><text for="L17">明明只想赌气发一句「讨厌你」</text><text for="L18">输入法可别自作多情转成了「好喜欢」</text><text for="L19">别再将「生生世世」与「永不分离」</text><text for="L20">拼凑在一起</text><text for="L21">明明反反复复删改了无数遍</text><text for="L22">屏幕上却依旧打出那些言不由衷的字句</text><text for="L23">我到底想让你怎么做呢</text><text for="L24">我也不明白 算了 随它去吧</text><text for="L25">这样下去 根本什么也不会改变吧</text><text for="L26">明知会落空 却还在暗暗期盼着什么吧</text><text for="L27">你在忙什么呢</text><text for="L28">怎么突然找我</text><text for="L29">哪怕就聊十分钟 陪我说说话好吗</text><text for="L30">明早我还得早起赶时间</text><text for="L31">聊着聊着可能会不小心睡着</text><text for="L32">这样也没关系吗</text><text for="L33">每当你困倦的话音渐渐化作轻柔吐息</text><text for="L34">便能真切感到你实实在在地伴在身旁</text><text for="L35">就算那只是一场梦也好</text><text for="L36">那句哽在喉头的「好想见你」</text><text for="L37">你听来会不会觉得难受</text><text for="L38">不如干脆 这辈子</text><text for="L39">都不要再说出口为好吧</text><text for="L40">多想狠下心发一句「恨透你了」</text><text for="L41">可千万别下意识换成了「最喜欢你」</text><text for="L42">莫再将「一生一世」和「长相厮守」</text><text for="L43">别再把它们并排写下</text><text for="L44">一次次在对话框里打了又删</text><text for="L45">翻来覆去发送的却总是同一番话</text><text for="L46">可我究竟想让你做些什么呢</text><text for="L47">早就想不透了 哎 罢了 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(罢了)</span></text><text for="L48">到头来 一切依旧毫无起色吧</text><text for="L49">注定要失望 却依然无可救药地期待着吧</text><text for="L50">越是顺着心意走</text><text for="L51">心中描绘的理想就越渐行渐远</text><text for="L52">多希望能再贴近彼此一点</text><text for="L53">哪怕认真地彼此说着「不是这样」</text><text for="L54">就连这些也快要忘记了啊</text><text for="L55">心底叫嚣着想发一句「别再理我」</text><text for="L56">求你别擅自联想成「不能没有你」</text><text for="L57">不要把「地久天长」与「执手同行」</text><text for="L58">连缀成句</text><text for="L59">哪怕敲敲打打重写过千百回</text><text for="L60">脱口而出的还是那些话</text><text for="L61">我究竟还想让你做什么呢</text><text for="L62">谁知道呢 算啦 没所谓了 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(无所谓了)</span></text><text for="L63">照这样 终究什么都无法挽回吧</text><text for="L64">明明知道期待会落空 却还是在期待着什么呢</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata><amll:meta key="musicName" value="source"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="iyaiiya"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="MIREI"/><amll:meta key="album" value="iyaiiya - Single"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1536633324"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPU902002643"/></metadata></head><body><div begin="0:13.642" end="4:12.111"><p begin="0:13.642" end="0:15.082" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:13.642" end="0:13.922">ねぇ</span><span begin="0:13.922" end="0:14.372">何</span><span begin="0:14.372" end="0:14.562">し</span><span begin="0:14.562" end="0:14.832">て</span><span begin="0:14.832" end="0:15.082">る？</span></p><p begin="0:15.092" end="0:16.672" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:15.092" end="0:15.742">どう</span><span begin="0:15.742" end="0:16.001">し</span><span begin="0:16.001" end="0:16.332">た</span><span begin="0:16.472" end="0:16.672">の？</span></p><p begin="0:16.899" end="0:19.639" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:16.899" end="0:17.139">10</span><span begin="0:17.289" end="0:17.729">分</span><span begin="0:17.729" end="0:17.839">だ</span><span begin="0:17.839" end="0:18.129">け</span><span begin="0:18.129" end="0:18.269">で</span><span begin="0:18.269" end="0:18.509">も</span> <span begin="0:18.509" end="0:19.079">話</span><span begin="0:19.079" end="0:19.349">せ</span><span begin="0:19.349" end="0:19.639">ない？</span></p><p begin="0:19.970" end="0:21.920" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:19.970" end="0:20.550">何</span><span begin="0:20.560" end="0:21.300">があ</span><span begin="0:21.300" end="0:21.460">っ</span><span begin="0:21.460" end="0:21.640">た</span><span begin="0:21.640" end="0:21.920">の？</span></p><p begin="0:22.364" end="0:24.364" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:22.364" end="0:22.504">い</span><span begin="0:22.504" end="0:22.704">や</span><span begin="0:22.704" end="0:23.154">特</span><span begin="0:23.154" end="0:23.284">に</span><span begin="0:23.284" end="0:23.584">なん</span><span begin="0:23.584" end="0:23.744">も</span><span begin="0:23.744" end="0:24.004">ない</span><span begin="0:24.004" end="0:24.174">け</span><span begin="0:24.174" end="0:24.364">ど</span></p><p begin="0:24.524" end="0:27.104" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:24.524" end="0:24.774">ちょっ</span><span begin="0:24.774" end="0:24.974">と</span><span begin="0:24.974" end="0:25.204">だ</span><span begin="0:25.204" end="0:25.394">け</span><span begin="0:25.394" end="0:25.654">で</span><span begin="0:25.654" end="0:25.784">も</span><span begin="0:25.784" end="0:26.034">声</span><span begin="0:26.034" end="0:26.464">聞き</span><span begin="0:26.464" end="0:26.604">た</span><span begin="0:26.604" end="0:26.864">く</span><span begin="0:26.864" end="0:27.104">て</span></p><p begin="0:27.392" end="0:29.522" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:27.392" end="0:27.732">そっ</span><span begin="0:27.732" end="0:27.892">か</span><span begin="0:27.892" end="0:28.142">で</span><span begin="0:28.142" end="0:28.292">も</span><span begin="0:28.292" end="0:28.582">今日</span><span begin="0:28.582" end="0:28.712">は</span><span begin="0:28.712" end="0:28.972">もう</span><span begin="0:28.972" end="0:29.422">眠いん</span><span begin="0:29.422" end="0:29.522">だ</span></p><p begin="0:29.522" end="0:30.422" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:29.522" end="0:29.822">ご</span><span begin="0:29.822" end="0:30.242">めん</span><span begin="0:30.242" end="0:30.422">ね</span></p><p begin="0:30.654" end="0:32.014" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:30.654" end="0:30.754">わ</span><span begin="0:30.754" end="0:31.054">かっ</span><span begin="0:31.054" end="0:31.174">た</span><span begin="0:31.174" end="0:31.484">しょう</span><span begin="0:31.484" end="0:31.604">が</span><span begin="0:31.604" end="0:31.874">ない</span><span begin="0:31.874" end="0:32.014">ね</span></p><p begin="0:32.017" end="0:33.917" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:32.017" end="0:32.447">じゃあお</span><span begin="0:32.447" end="0:32.897">休</span><span begin="0:32.897" end="0:33.147">み</span><span begin="0:33.147" end="0:33.577">だ</span><span begin="0:33.577" end="0:33.917">ね</span></p><p begin="0:34.810" end="0:37.460" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:34.810" end="0:34.970">こ</span><span begin="0:34.970" end="0:35.280">れ</span><span begin="0:35.280" end="0:35.380">を</span><span begin="0:35.380" end="0:36.070">我慢っ</span><span begin="0:36.070" end="0:36.180">て</span><span begin="0:36.180" end="0:36.480">感</span><span begin="0:36.480" end="0:36.640">じ</span><span begin="0:36.640" end="0:36.880">る</span><span begin="0:36.880" end="0:37.050">の</span><span begin="0:37.050" end="0:37.460">は</span></p><p begin="0:37.460" end="0:39.660" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:37.460" end="0:37.690">ワ</span><span begin="0:37.690" end="0:38.110">ガ</span><span begin="0:38.110" end="0:38.520">マ</span><span begin="0:38.520" end="0:39.660">マ？</span></p><p begin="0:40.451" end="0:43.721" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:40.451" end="0:40.841">ア</span><span begin="0:40.841" end="0:40.991">イ</span><span begin="0:40.991" end="0:41.431">コン</span><span begin="0:41.431" end="0:41.621">の</span><span begin="0:41.621" end="0:42.071">中</span><span begin="0:42.071" end="0:42.301">で</span><span begin="0:42.301" end="0:42.701">笑っ</span><span begin="0:42.701" end="0:42.911">て</span><span begin="0:42.911" end="0:43.091">る</span><span begin="0:43.291" end="0:43.431">キ</span><span begin="0:43.431" end="0:43.581">ミ</span><span begin="0:43.581" end="0:43.721">と</span></p><p begin="0:43.723" end="0:46.603" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:43.723" end="0:43.973">前</span><span begin="0:43.973" end="0:44.133">よ</span><span begin="0:44.133" end="0:44.253">り</span><span begin="0:44.253" end="0:44.403">目</span><span begin="0:44.403" end="0:44.663">が合</span><span begin="0:44.663" end="0:44.823">わ</span><span begin="0:44.823" end="0:44.953">な</span><span begin="0:44.953" end="0:45.223">く</span><span begin="0:45.223" end="0:45.643">なっ</span><span begin="0:45.643" end="0:45.793">た</span><span begin="0:45.793" end="0:46.013">み</span><span begin="0:46.013" end="0:46.283">た</span><span begin="0:46.283" end="0:46.603">い</span></p><p begin="0:47.019" end="0:49.319" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:47.019" end="0:47.479">どう</span><span begin="0:47.479" end="0:47.729">だ</span><span begin="0:47.729" end="0:47.829">っ</span><span begin="0:47.829" end="0:48.089">け</span> <span begin="0:48.319" end="0:48.719">どう</span><span begin="0:48.719" end="0:49.049">やっ</span><span begin="0:49.049" end="0:49.319">て</span></p><p begin="0:49.575" end="0:52.755" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:49.575" end="0:49.765">見</span><span begin="0:49.765" end="0:49.935">つ</span><span begin="0:49.935" end="0:50.265">め</span><span begin="0:50.265" end="0:50.425">合</span><span begin="0:50.425" end="0:50.765">え</span><span begin="0:50.765" end="0:50.995">て</span><span begin="0:50.995" end="0:51.265">た</span><span begin="0:51.265" end="0:51.485">ん</span><span begin="0:51.485" end="0:51.835">だ</span><span begin="0:51.835" end="0:52.755">ろう？</span></p><p begin="0:53.278" end="0:56.258" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:53.278" end="0:54.118">「大嫌い」っ</span><span begin="0:54.118" end="0:54.378">て</span><span begin="0:54.378" end="0:54.848">送</span><span begin="0:54.848" end="0:55.068">り</span><span begin="0:55.068" end="0:55.678">た</span><span begin="0:55.678" end="0:55.788">い</span><span begin="0:55.788" end="0:56.078">か</span><span begin="0:56.078" end="0:56.258">ら</span></p><p begin="0:56.616" end="0:59.636" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:56.616" end="0:57.046">「大好</span><span begin="0:57.046" end="0:57.306">き」っ</span><span begin="0:57.306" end="0:57.446">て</span><span begin="0:57.446" end="0:58.236">変換</span><span begin="0:58.236" end="0:58.486">し</span><span begin="0:58.486" end="0:59.416">ない</span><span begin="0:59.416" end="0:59.636">で</span></p><p begin="0:59.910" end="1:02.940" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:59.910" end="1:00.190">「ず</span><span begin="1:00.190" end="1:00.290">っ</span><span begin="1:00.290" end="1:00.730">と</span><span begin="1:00.730" end="1:01.480">ずっ</span><span begin="1:01.480" end="1:01.930">と」「</span><span begin="1:01.930" end="1:02.700">一緒」っ</span><span begin="1:02.700" end="1:02.940">て</span></p><p begin="1:03.176" end="1:06.276" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.176" end="1:03.796">並</span><span begin="1:03.986" end="1:04.376">べ</span><span begin="1:04.376" end="1:04.626">な</span><span begin="1:04.846" end="1:05.376">い</span><span begin="1:05.376" end="1:06.276">で</span></p><p begin="1:06.537" end="1:09.627" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.537" end="1:07.017">何</span><span begin="1:07.017" end="1:07.317">回</span><span begin="1:07.317" end="1:07.607">も打</span><span begin="1:07.607" end="1:07.857">ち</span><span begin="1:07.857" end="1:08.357">直</span><span begin="1:08.357" end